> parity acos(x: real)
parity of acos(x):
  neither even nor odd
  not even: f(x) = 0, f(-x) = 3.141592654 at x = 1
  not odd: f(x) = 0, f(-x) = 3.141592654 at x = 1
  checked numerically at 2000 points of [-10, 10]
